1
00:00:00,229 --> 00:00:02,029
(Raj:)I don't freaking
believe this!

2
00:00:02,032 --> 00:00:03,302
(Howard:)Relax, it'll be fine.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,070
(Raj:)No, you have to put
this back together

4
00:00:05,068 --> 00:00:06,898
(Raj:)right now,
so I can return it!

5
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:08,574
(Sheldon:)You can't return it.

6
00:00:08,572 --> 00:00:11,542
(Sheldon:)Howard wiped his bottom
with the warranty.

7
00:00:11,542 --> 00:00:13,312
What?!

8
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:15,080
(Sheldon:)I think metaphorically.

9
00:00:15,078 --> 00:00:17,378
(Sheldon:)But he was in the bathroom
for a while.

10
00:00:19,882 --> 00:00:21,182
(Raj:)Howard, my father cut me off.

11
00:00:21,184 --> 00:00:22,914
(Raj:)I have to get my money back
for this!

12
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,050
(Howard:)Calm down.

13
00:00:24,054 --> 00:00:25,324
(Leonard:)Okay.

14
00:00:25,322 --> 00:00:27,222
(Raj:)Okay, you're right.

15
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:29,194
(Raj:)It's time for me to step up

16
00:00:29,192 --> 00:00:30,922
(Raj:)and take responsibility
for my life.

17
00:00:32,028 --> 00:00:33,158
(Raj:)Be a man.

18
00:00:35,731 --> 00:00:38,771
(Raj:)Hello, Mummy.

19
00:00:38,769 --> 00:00:40,239
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)Hello, Rajesh.

20
00:00:40,237 --> 00:00:42,167
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)What a nice surprise.

21
00:00:42,172 --> 00:00:43,242
(Raj:)Well, I've been
thinking about you.

22
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,410
(Raj:)How are you doing?

23
00:00:44,408 --> 00:00:46,078
(Raj:)Are you happy, Mummy?

24
00:00:46,776 --> 00:00:48,776
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)Such a sweet boy for asking.

25
00:00:48,779 --> 00:00:52,919
(Mrs Koothrapalli:)Can't believe you come from
the poison seed of your father.

26
00:00:52,916 --> 00:00:55,216
(Raj:)Well, I like to think
I take mostly after you.

27
00:00:55,218 --> 00:00:56,848
(Raj:)Anyway,
speaking of Daddy,

28
00:00:56,853 --> 00:00:59,183
(Raj:)I had a very strange
conversation with him.

